{"name":"Float Your Boat","hex":"#93c5b6","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"float your boat","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Verb","definitions":["To interest or appeal to someone; to make someone happy."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/float_your_boat"}],"entries":[{"title":"Float Your Boat (RuPaul's Drag Race)","blocks":[{"text":"\"Float Your Boat\" is the sixth episode of the fourth season of the American television series RuPaul's Drag Race. It originally aired on March 5, 2012. The episode's main challenge tasks the contestants with creating and wearing a pride float based on a color of the pride flag. Billy B, Kelly Osbourne, and Pauley Perrette are guest judges."}],"link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Float_Your_Boat_(RuPaul's_Drag_Race)"},{"title":"You","blocks":[{"text":"In Modern English, the word \"you\" is the second-person pronoun. It is grammatically plural, and was historically used only for the dative case, but in most modern dialects is used for all cases and numbers."}],"link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/You"},{"title":"Boat","blocks":[{"text":"A boat is a watercraft of a large range of types and sizes, but generally smaller than a ship, which is distinguished by its larger size or capacity, its shape, or its ability to carry boats."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d9/Motorboat_at_Kankaria_lake.JPG/330px-Motorboat_at_Kankaria_lake.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Boat"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/5b/Dragcon3-SUN-3_%2847942905293%29.jpg/500px-Dragcon3-SUN-3_%2847942905293%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/5b/Dragcon3-SUN-3_%2847942905293%29.jpg/1280px-Dragcon3-SUN-3_%2847942905293%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x